ff/Directory Organizational Structure IHR By the Numbers Contact Us Search for: Job Seekers Job Seekers Job Postings Why Work at Illinois Executive Level Positions Extra Help Services Quick Links Illinois Value Proposition How to Apply Instructions Our Community Benefits & Well-Being Benefits Benefits Chart Total Compensation Calculator Well-Being Work Well Spotlight Focusing Amidst Distractions Quick Links Counseling Services Workplace Flexibility Crisis Support My Employee Experience Illinois Value Proposition IVP Builder IVP Resources IVP Engagement New Employee Onboarding Orientation Resources Workplace Flexibility The Illinois Professional Current Employees Learning & Development Engagement Opportunities Performance Management Recognition Leaving the University Quick Links AI Professional Development Series Benefits Chart HR Career Architecture Pay & Time-Entry Resources Policies A-Z New Supervisor Resources Services & Information Services Service Center Matrix Teams Learning & Development Employee Relations (LER) Consulting (ELOE) Counseling & Well-Being Resources Information Forms Job Aids HR Applications Pay & Time-Entry Resources HR Document Library Processes Hiring Employees Performance Management Promotion / Reclassification Time Reporting Separations Leaves Policies A-Z Index Quick Links AI Professional Development Series Civil Service Salary Plan HR Collaborative JDXpert Service Catalog About Centers of Expertise Compensation, Classification & Career Architecture HR Applications & Information Services HR Data Operations Labor & Employee Relations Matrix Teams Talent Culture, Learning & Engagement Employee Engagement & Recognition Employee Learning & Organizational Effectiveness Faculty/Staff Assistance and Well-Being Services Strategic Programs & Partnerships HR Analytics About Administration Policy Design & Administration Meet Our Staff/Directory Organizational Structure IHR By the Numbers Contact Us Campus Holidays Home 5 Campus Holiday Schedule Campus Holiday Schedule Holiday Schedule 2026 – 2027 Campus Holiday Schedule 2026 – 2027 Date Weekday Holiday July 3, 2026 Friday Independence Day September 7, 2026 Monday Labor Day November 26, 2026 Thursday Thanksgiving Day November 27, 2026 Friday Day after Thanksgiving (Designated Holiday) December 24, 2026 Thursday Gift Day December 25, 2026 Friday Christmas Day Holiday December 28, 2026 Monday Day after Christmas (Designated Holiday) December 29, 2026 Tuesday Gift Day December 30, 2026 Wednesday Gift Day December 31, 2026 Thursday President Designated Holiday January 1, 2027 Friday New Year’s Day Holiday January 18, 2027 Monday Martin Luther King, Jr. Day (Designated Holiday) May 31, 2027 Monday Memorial Day June 18, 2027 Friday Juneteenth Day (Recognized) Download Holiday Schedule (PDF) Gift Days December 24, 29, and 30 of 2026 have been designated as “gift days,” meaning that employees are excused from work with pay without having to charge a benefit. If an employee is required to work on one or more of those days, they must receive an alternate gift day that must be used by June 30, 2027. A gift day is a paid day (use of benefit time is not required) provided to leave benefit eligible employees. Essential employees who must work on a designated gift day may use their gift day at a later time in the current fiscal year, with supervisor approval. Unused gift days are not paid out at the time of termination and do not roll over into the next fiscal year. For other questions related to gift days, contact Labor and Employee Relations at 333-3105. Employees have two Floating Holidays (must be taken in full day increments) that can be used any time from July 1, 2026, until June 30, 2027. However, the scheduling of these two Floating Holidays are subject to unit approval. Unused floating holidays are not paid out at the time of termination and do not roll over into the next fiscal year. Subscribe to the Campus Holiday Calendar Choose your calendar platform below to subscribe. Future updates will sync automatically once added. Google Calendar Outlook Calendar Download (.ics) For Outlook Click Outlook Calendar above Select Add calendar Choose Subscribe from web Paste the calendar link below and select Import Copy Link Illinois Human Resources Follow Follow Follow Follow Personnel Services Building – MC 562 52 E. Gregory Dr., Champaign, IL 61820 Phone: 217-333-2137 Email: ihr@illinois.edu Hours of Operations Monday – Friday: 8:30 A.M. – 12:00 P.M., 1:00 P.M. – 5:00 P.M. Resources About Campus Holiday Schedule Site navigation help Jobs.illinois.edu HR Collaborative MyUInfo Connect Are you a Job Seeker? Who is my unit HR Contact? General HR Questions? Want to share website feedback? If you have difficulty accessing this site, please contact IHR Marketing & Communications for assistance. Explore Campus University Admissions Careers at Illinois University News Visit Campus Connect with Illinois University Alumni Giving at Illinois University Calendars University Directory Access University Resources Emergency Services McKinley Health Center Connie Frank CARE Center University Library About Cookies Privacy Copyright Accessibility"
    },
