ts & Well-Being Benefits & Well-Being Well-Being Benefits Chart Being an Illinois Professional Illinois Value Proposition Purpose & Passion Total Rewards/Benefits Holistic Well-Being Learning & Growth University Culture Being an Illinois Professional At the University of Illinois Urbana-Champaign, we believe in helping you discover your purpose and passion, by providing an environment where your professional journey aligns with your personal aspirations. The Illinois Professional Total Rewards = Compensation/Benefits The University of Illinois Urbana-Champaign takes pride in offering comprehensive total compensation packages that extend well beyond monetary rewards, providing you with an array of valuable benefits to support your overall well-being. Why Illinois Ensuring Holistic Well-Being for all Employees We prioritize holistic well-being for our employees, offering comprehensive programs and support to ensure you thrive both personally and professionally. Culture, Learning, and Engagement Unlocking Your Potential The university fosters a culture of continuous learning and growth, where your professional development is a top priority, and opportunities for skill enhancement and career advancement are endless. Culture, Learning, And Engagement A World-Class Leader Since its founding in 1867, the University of Illinois Urbana-Champaign has earned a reputation as a world-class leader in research, teaching, and public engagement. University of Illinois Website Benefits The University of Illinois Urbana-Champaign offers a wide range of exceptional benefits to our employees. Our benefits encompass competitive compensation, comprehensive healthcare coverage, retirement savings plans, and generous time off. We prioritize a flexible workplace that suits your needs. Benefits Chart Well-Being Our holistic well-being programs encompass physical, mental, and financial wellness, with resources to help you thrive in every aspect of your life. Visit the campus-wide wellness website for more information on the programs and resources available to you as an employee. Mental Health & Wellness Illinois Human Resources Follow Follow Follow Follow Personnel Services Building – MC 562 52 E. Gregory Dr., Champaign, IL 61820 Phone: 217-333-2137 Email: ihr@illinois.edu Hours of Operations Monday – Friday: 8:30 A.M. – 12:00 P.M., 1:00 P.M. – 5:00 P.M. Resources About Campus Holiday Schedule Site navigation help Jobs.illinois.edu HR Collaborative MyUInfo Connect Are you a Job Seeker? Who is my unit HR Contact? General HR Questions? Want to share website feedback? If you have difficulty accessing this site, please contact IHR Marketing & Communications for assistance. Explore Campus University Admissions Careers at Illinois University News Visit Campus Connect with Illinois University Alumni Giving at Illinois University Calendars University Directory Access University Resources Emergency Services McKinley Health Center Connie Frank CARE Center University Library About Cookies Privacy Copyright Accessibility"
