ent. Home 5 My Employee Experience My Employee Experience New Employee Current Employee Leaving the University Your Employee Journey Welcome to the heart of a vibrant midwestern community, where our commitment to excellence is upheld by a dedicated workforce exceeding over 31,000 individuals. Our diverse community plays a pivotal role in shaping the success and innovation of our institution. Whether you’re a new recruit, a current employee, or a valued retiree, join us in contributing to a dynamic environment that celebrates the collective achievements. We look forward to your journey with us. New Employee Welcome to Illinois! You have joined a world-class university, and we’re glad you are here. New Employee Current Employees A current university employee looking for resources. Current Employee Leaving the University Individuals searching for guidance and support for life’s transitions. Leaving the University Benefits & Well-Being Celebrating Our Employees Grow Your Career Performance Review Support Services Workplace-Flexibility Resources Illinois Human Resources Follow Follow Follow Follow Personnel Services Building – MC 562 52 E. Gregory Dr., Champaign, IL 61820 Phone: 217-333-2137 Email: ihr@illinois.edu Hours of Operations Monday – Friday: 8:30 A.M. – 12:00 P.M., 1:00 P.M. – 5:00 P.M. Resources About Campus Holiday Schedule Site navigation help Jobs.illinois.edu HR Collaborative MyUInfo Connect Are you a Job Seeker? Who is my unit HR Contact? General HR Questions? Want to share website feedback? If you have difficulty accessing this site, please contact IHR Marketing & Communications for assistance. Explore Campus University Admissions Careers at Illinois University News Visit Campus Connect with Illinois University Alumni Giving at Illinois University Calendars University Directory Access University Resources Emergency Services McKinley Health Center Connie Frank CARE Center University Library About Cookies Privacy Copyright Accessibility"
