f/Directory Organizational Structure IHR By the Numbers Contact Us Search for: Job Seekers Job Seekers Job Postings Why Work at Illinois Executive Level Positions Extra Help Services Quick Links Illinois Value Proposition How to Apply Instructions Our Community Benefits & Well-Being Benefits Benefits Chart Total Compensation Calculator Well-Being Work Well Spotlight Focusing Amidst Distractions Quick Links Counseling Services Workplace Flexibility Crisis Support My Employee Experience Illinois Value Proposition IVP Builder IVP Resources IVP Engagement New Employee Onboarding Orientation Resources Workplace Flexibility The Illinois Professional Current Employees Learning & Development Engagement Opportunities Performance Management Recognition Leaving the University Quick Links AI Professional Development Series Benefits Chart HR Career Architecture Pay & Time-Entry Resources Policies A-Z New Supervisor Resources Services & Information Services Service Center Matrix Teams Learning & Development Employee Relations (LER) Consulting (ELOE) Counseling & Well-Being Resources Information Forms Job Aids HR Applications Pay & Time-Entry Resources HR Document Library Processes Hiring Employees Performance Management Promotion / Reclassification Time Reporting Separations Leaves Policies A-Z Index Quick Links AI Professional Development Series Civil Service Salary Plan HR Collaborative JDXpert Service Catalog About Centers of Expertise Compensation, Classification & Career Architecture HR Applications & Information Services HR Data Operations Labor & Employee Relations Matrix Teams Talent Culture, Learning & Engagement Employee Engagement & Recognition Employee Learning & Organizational Effectiveness Faculty/Staff Assistance and Well-Being Services Strategic Programs & Partnerships HR Analytics About Administration Policy Design & Administration Meet Our Staff/Directory Organizational Structure IHR By the Numbers Contact Us Services & Information Empowering Excellence Together Home 5 Services & Information Services & Information Services Resources Policies and Guidelines Processes Services & Information Welcome to our services and information! We’re here to provide you with valuable resources, assistance, and guidance to help you make informed decisions and access to what you need. Whether you’re looking for information on a specific topic, seeking support, or exploring available services, we’ve got you covered. HR Applications HR applications are integral tools that streamline and enhance various human resources functions within an organization. These platforms, such as HR Front End (HRFE), BANNER, PARIS, UI New Hire, and I-9 Tracker, facilitate efficient management of personnel-related processes. From onboarding new hires to tracking employee data, benefits administration, and handling payroll, HR systems play a pivotal role in ensuring accuracy, compliance, and seamless operations. Applications Services & Information Services Resources Policies Processes Services IHR strives to provide exceptional services tailored to meet your unique needs and exceed your expectations. Our comprehensive range of services is designed to support you in various aspects of your life, whether personal or professional. Here's an overview of the services we offer: Services Include: Service Center Matrix Teams Learning & Development Employee Relations (LER) Organizational Development Counseling & Well-Being Resources At the University of Illinois Urbana-Champaign, we offer a wide range of resources for faculty and staff. Our Information hub is a central source for essential documents, policies, and forms, simplifying administrative tasks. Job aids provide step-by-step guidance, and our HR systems ensure accurate time tracking and compensation. Our user-friendly platforms support tasks like performance management and recruitment, fostering employee engagement and organizational effectiveness. We're dedicated to providing accessible and inclusive resources to support our university community. Resources Include: Information Forms Job Aids Pay & Time Reporting HR Applications Policies The University of Illinois Urbana-Champaign's policy page offers a concise yet comprehensive overview of our commitment to excellence and integrity. Covering diverse areas from human resources to academic integrity, these policies reflect our dedication to fairness, inclusion, and transparency. Regular updates ensure that all members of our community stay informed and aligned with our shared values. Policies and Guidelines A to Z listing of policies Processes HR processes manage the full employee lifecycle, from recruitment to offboarding, ensuring organizational efficiency and workforce success through structured activities. Processes include: Hiring Employees Performance Management Promotion/Reclassification Pay and Time Reporting Separation Leaves Illinois Human Resources Follow Follow Follow Follow Personnel Services Building – MC 562 52 E. Gregory Dr., Champaign, IL 61820 Phone: 217-333-2137 Email: ihr@illinois.edu Hours of Operations Monday – Friday: 8:30 A.M. – 12:00 P.M., 1:00 P.M. – 5:00 P.M. Resources About Campus Holiday Schedule Site navigation help Jobs.illinois.edu HR Collaborative MyUInfo Connect Are you a Job Seeker? Who is my unit HR Contact? General HR Questions? Want to share website feedback? If you have difficulty accessing this site, please contact IHR Marketing & Communications for assistance. Explore Campus University Admissions Careers at Illinois University News Visit Campus Connect with Illinois University Alumni Giving at Illinois University Calendars University Directory Access University Resources Emergency Services McKinley Health Center Connie Frank CARE Center University Library About Cookies Privacy Copyright Accessibility"
    },
