irectory Organizational Structure IHR By the Numbers Contact Us Search for: Job Seekers Job Seekers Job Postings Why Work at Illinois Executive Level Positions Extra Help Services Quick Links Illinois Value Proposition How to Apply Instructions Our Community Benefits & Well-Being Benefits Benefits Chart Total Compensation Calculator Well-Being Work Well Spotlight Focusing Amidst Distractions Quick Links Counseling Services Workplace Flexibility Crisis Support My Employee Experience Illinois Value Proposition IVP Builder IVP Resources IVP Engagement New Employee Onboarding Orientation Resources Workplace Flexibility The Illinois Professional Current Employees Learning & Development Engagement Opportunities Performance Management Recognition Leaving the University Quick Links AI Professional Development Series Benefits Chart HR Career Architecture Pay & Time-Entry Resources Policies A-Z New Supervisor Resources Services & Information Services Service Center Matrix Teams Learning & Development Employee Relations (LER) Consulting (ELOE) Counseling & Well-Being Resources Information Forms Job Aids HR Applications Pay & Time-Entry Resources HR Document Library Processes Hiring Employees Performance Management Promotion / Reclassification Time Reporting Separations Leaves Policies A-Z Index Quick Links AI Professional Development Series Civil Service Salary Plan HR Collaborative JDXpert Service Catalog About Centers of Expertise Compensation, Classification & Career Architecture HR Applications & Information Services HR Data Operations Labor & Employee Relations Matrix Teams Talent Culture, Learning & Engagement Employee Engagement & Recognition Employee Learning & Organizational Effectiveness Faculty/Staff Assistance and Well-Being Services Strategic Programs & Partnerships HR Analytics About Administration Policy Design & Administration Meet Our Staff/Directory Organizational Structure IHR By the Numbers Contact Us HR Document Library Home 5 HR Document Library HR Document Library HR Document Library The HR Document Library includes many frequently used resources. Please note that it contains only documents currently published on the Illinois Human Resources website and is not intended to serve as a comprehensive repository of all HR-related documents. The library provides a centralized, searchable location for accessing documents from across the Illinois Human Resources website. Designed to help users quickly find forms, guides, policies, and other resources, it brings together documents attached to IHR web pages in one convenient place. Loading documents... Error loading documents. Please check that the JSON file exists and is accessible. Search documents by name Filter by category All Categories Filter by format All Formats Filter by year All Years Loading... HR document directory Document Name ↕ Category Format Last Updated ↕ Action No documents found Try adjusting your search or filter criteria Previous Next Illinois Human Resources Follow Follow Follow Follow Personnel Services Building – MC 562 52 E. Gregory Dr., Champaign, IL 61820 Phone: 217-333-2137 Email: ihr@illinois.edu Hours of Operations Monday – Friday: 8:30 A.M. – 12:00 P.M., 1:00 P.M. – 5:00 P.M. Resources About Campus Holiday Schedule Site navigation help Jobs.illinois.edu HR Collaborative MyUInfo Connect Are you a Job Seeker? Who is my unit HR Contact? General HR Questions? Want to share website feedback? If you have difficulty accessing this site, please contact IHR Marketing & Communications for assistance. Explore Campus University Admissions Careers at Illinois University News Visit Campus Connect with Illinois University Alumni Giving at Illinois University Calendars University Directory Access University Resources Emergency Services McKinley Health Center Connie Frank CARE Center University Library About Cookies Privacy Copyright Accessibility"
